{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"203b3c3ef9badeee7c8692d899cfd7d32430b1e9edc500b4b7b9da3157af2616","ja":"プロレス観戦","zh":"观赏摔角比赛","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6539282f7406a50bfaa7cc2ef28e93d1db4aa9a1931c00069421f3def5fc8666","ja":"それじゃあさっそく、動画を流すね。\nこの試合、すっごく盛り上がったんだっ♪","zh":"那么马上开始放视频啦。\n这场比赛当时可是超级热烈的哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8fe17f1e6d265f73c92769411ab000fbeec5005504e7cddd7fffaf7c53d85686","ja":"は、はい。よろしくお願いいたします……。","zh":"好、好的。请多关照……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329","ja":"数分後……","zh":"过了几分钟后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"3582561876e63d1df4eb850a93e1d7b673ed0b031bd456f50c44950afd88e848","ja":"「決まった～～！　ラビットマスクのウルトラ\nラビットドロップ！　これには相手も悶絶～～～！」","zh":"“成功使出这一招了～～！兔面人的超级\n飞兔踢！对手也因此痛苦倒地～～～！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"89c713c4856112dbaa2500286d2cf209701478d64d6ea6387b8ca76e7523cc4f","ja":"なっ……！？　あ、あんなに勢いよく頭を打って、\n痛くないのでしょうか……！？","zh":"什……！？那么用力地撞到头，\n难道不痛吗……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"5d3207670f1fd845a48bed303b247f3596b7cc8011543d7971b37ded8510811d","ja":"痛いと思うよ。けどプロレスって、\n相手の技を受けてこそ盛り上がるから！","zh":"肯定会很痛的吧。但摔角这种运动，\n正是接下对手的招式才精彩啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"8b68c140aaf9eb5900b44de5eb3343bd552f90d72c5a3e0665e7dab80b1095dd","ja":"な、なんだか未知の世界すぎて、\n頭が追いつかないです……。","zh":"总、总觉得涉足了未知的领域，\n脑子有点转不过来了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"718f302b4fb6258fa61c0921a4d07145a5fc0d8c71744697d7790a1117833c79","ja":"「客席の雑魚ども！　ブーイングなんてしてないで\nこのラビットマスク様にかかってこいよ！　オラァ！」","zh":"“观众席上的杂鱼们！别光顾着喝倒彩，\n有本事就冲着本兔面具大人来啊！喂！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"53b17566093417940996d8334fddf99f58cdc259bc8279276cf0121f05937c96","ja":"お、お客様に暴言まで！？","zh":"对、对客人甚至还出言不逊！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"ebecada0ff5f9d3061db9b16f3b3aa2c9c79b3f8ae9b316da53cc83ab87ec546","ja":"あははっ♪\n紬の反応、かわいいな～！　なんだか新鮮かも！","zh":"啊哈哈♪\n紬的反应真可爱～！总觉得很新鲜呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"bef0ea4c3f5bbfa89a8630398b9ff1b7631676b8f10cca14b2874dc65b1e6496","ja":"ぷ、プロレスはこれが普通なのですか？\n……あっ、今度はあんな所に登って……！","zh":"职业摔角这样是正常的吗？\n……啊，这次又爬到那种地方去了……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"5b99998cbec9bc2a88000f5b804f95b88788acae9785119d5ab43c8e04679dda","ja":"しっかり見ててね！　コーナーポストからの\n大技が決まるから……。","zh":"好好看着吧！从角柱上发起的\n绝招马上就要成了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"8b3ecf5735ae6c022444994e44b814b37d7ecb1bcb4755467ad862ce89915b87","ja":"ええっ……！\nあ、あんなところからジャンプを……！","zh":"诶……！\n竟、竟然从那种地方跳下来……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"13569dfbbf16a9ca18281ec661dc9f9b74a2d8d38af17661cfd12a3c6db5b26a","ja":"さらに十数分後……","zh":"又过了十几分钟……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"399635f5ec5dabc1d38a0383439ebfc1d8af1e053b71db55e6730ac56ddae775","ja":"カンカンカンカンカン！","zh":"铛铛铛铛铛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"1e2a5bf8ee60c39f6941309858f7c3401bd14d776c80ff4eb8a13fc7f4a858a6","ja":"はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……。こ、これで終了でしょうか？\nなんだか、見ているだけで疲れてしまいました……。","zh":"哈啊、哈啊、哈啊……这、这就结束了吗？\n总觉得光是在一旁看着，就已经累坏了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"d3b94cf84e1c3b945a7302234fec9169ae9bf45730bf0f192c1469e00fb4e54d","ja":"うん、試合は終了♪\nこのあとマイクパフォーマンスがあるから。","zh":"嗯，比赛结束了♪\n接下来还有麦克风表演哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"71283fd0982f511057127f6acb48af99a926065773824afd62d209e023f55a1c","ja":"「……ベルトはラビットマスク様の物だ！\n文句がある奴は、いつでもかかってこい！」","zh":"「……金腰带是兔面具大人的所有物！\n有不服的家伙，随时放马过来吧！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"108776a301bf10e1807282d73c3c406352d775c8fb592e5d31bfff12e2b2567f","ja":"「それじゃあ、いくぜーっ！！\nスリー、ツゥー……ラビットーっ！！」","zh":"“那么，要上啦——！！\nThree、Two……Rabbit——！！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"d254004ab2f44b179ca8e60d1ecba4869451b8652b4fd69c70be97cafafe1888","ja":"ワアアアアアッ！","zh":"哇啊啊啊啊啊！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"f6eca06c4528375f1c5fe99ad4e9071786002a83945cab80f904e1cc34a65838","ja":"あ、あの、福田さん、\n最後のはなんでしょう……？","zh":"那个，福田小姐，\n最后那一下是什么呢……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"d528bac9f0e6601ae5048a9a868351ce3c51d5c9affed8225fe0cc8ba6b69ef1","ja":"あれはお約束のパフォーマンス。\nすっごく盛り上がるんだよ！","zh":"那是惯例的保留表演。\n现场气氛会超级热烈的哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1051.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"f2a8ed2be04014baf8128861e2feecfb6cf1aa9bb07dec9dffbb7342cf54bff7","ja":"お約束のパフォーマンス……。\n確かに、会場がとても盛り上がってますね……。","zh":"标志性的表演……。\n确实，现场的气氛非常热烈呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
